High Magic is the symbolic and syntactic magic of the high elves: elaborate, showy, Taoist-influenced, and especially suited to powerful enchantment. Its symbols do not resemble writing to the untrained eye, instead appearing as murals, paintings, mosaics, or intricate carved sculptures. A practitioner may learn High Magic purely for symbolic enchantment or as a syntactic Word magic for direct casting. Anyone who knows the syntactic form may also enchant with its symbols.

